<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">2 Korinth</book>
  <para style="h">2 Korinth</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Korinth</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Korinth</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Korinth</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian duhzâwnga Krista tirhkoh Paula leh kan unaupa Timothea chuan, Korinth khuaa Pathian kohhran leh Akaia ram pum puia mi thianghlim awm zawng zawng chibai kan bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian, kan Pa leh Lalpa Isua Krista hnên ata khawngaihna leh remna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista Pa leh Pathian, khawngaihnaa khat, thlamuanna petu Pa Pathian hnênah chuan lâwmthu i sawi ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathianin min thlamuannain hrehawm tinrêng tuarte kan thlamuan ve theih nân, ani chuan kan hrehawm tuar zawng zawngah min thlamuan ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Krista tuar anga kan tuar tam poh leh Krista zâra kan thlamuanna chu a pung ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan tuarna hi in thlamuanna tûr leh in chhandamna tûr a ni. Kan thlamuanna hi nangni pawhin hrehawm kan lo tuar tawh ang chu chhel tak leh thlamuang taka in tuar ve theihna tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hrehawm min tuarpuitu in ni angin thlamuanna min chanpuitu tûr pawh in ni tih kan hria e; chuvângin, in chungah beiseina nghet tak kan nei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Unaute u, Asia rama hrehawm kan tuar kha in hriat loh kan duh lo ve; khatia tuar zawh rual loh phurritin min delh a, dam rêng kan inbeisei tawh lohzia kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thi ngei tûra tih niin kan inhria a; mahse, mahni inring lova, mitthi kaithotu Pathian chu kan rin zâwkna tûr a lo ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutia thih hlauhawm taka kan awm chu min chhan chhuak a, min chhan chhuak leh bawk ang a; min la chhan chhuak zêl ang tih kan ring tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ṭawngṭaiin min ṭanpui ula, mi tam tak ṭawngṭaina avângin khawngaihna kan dawng ang a, keimahni avângin mi tam takin Pathian hnênah lâwmthu an la sawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hei hi ka chhuang a ni: Mihring finna vâng ni lovin, Pathian finna vâng zâwkin Pathian hmuhah nun tlang leh rilru ngîl tak puin mi zîngah kan awm ṭhîn a, nangni zîngah phei chuan chutiangin kan awm lehzual ṭhîn tih ka chhia leh ṭha hriatna pawhin mi hriatpui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan lehkhaah khân, in chhiara in hriatthiam loh tûr eng mah kan ziak lo va, in la hriatthiam vek ka ring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tûnah in la hrethiam vek lo na a, Lalpa Isua Nî-a kan chhuan tûr in ni ang bawkin in chhuan tûr kan ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu chu ka rin tlat avângin hlâwkna thuah hnih in chan theih nân tlawh hmasak phawt che u ka tum a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />chuta ṭangin Makedonia ram ka fang zêl ang a, chumi zawhah Makedonia aṭanga Judai ram pana ka kal pahin rawn tlawh leh che u ka tum a, ka kalna tûra min puih ka beisei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hei hi ka tum dân chu a ni a, tum mumal nei lo ka ni em ni? A nih loh leh mihring taka a chânga, “Ni e, ni e,” tia a châng leh, “Ni lo ve, ni lo ve,” ti mai mai ka ni em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian chu a rinawm avângin in hnêna kan thu pawh a chânga, “Ni e,” a chânga, “Ni lo ve,” tih ang hi a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei leh Silvana leh Timothean in hnêna a chanchin kan hril, Isua Krista, Pathian Fapa chu, “A ni,” leh “A ni lo,” a ni kawp ve si lo. Chutih ahnêkin amahah chuan “A ni,” tih chauh a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian thutiam zawng zawng chu amahah chuan, “A ni,” tih vek a ni; chuvângin, keimahni avânga Pathian a ropuina tûrin Isua Krista zârah, “Amen,” kan ti ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kristaa keini leh nangni min tichaktu leh min serh hrangtu chu Pathian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ta-a min chhinchhiahtu leh kan thinlunga zakhamna Thlarau min petu pawh Pathian bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka nunna chhâlin thuhretu atân Pathian ka lam a ni, nangmahni zuah tûr che uin a ni Korinth khuaa ka lo kal tâk loh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />In rinna chungah intihlal kan tum lo ve, in lâwmna atân nangni nên kan thawk tlâng a ni zâwk, rinnaa ding in ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuvângin, in thin tina tûr chuan in hnênah lo kal leh tawh lo ila ka ti ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keiin in thin ka tihnat si chuan, nangni ka tihnatte vêk lo chuan tu nge mi tilâwm ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lo kal huna mi tilâwmtu tûrten ka thin in tihnat loh nân kha lehkha kha ka rawn thawn che u a ni, ka lâwmna chu in za-in mi lâwmpui ve ka ring tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mittui tam tak tla chungin, rilru mangang leh hrehawm ti chungin, in thin tina tûr ni lovin, ka hmangaihzia che u in hriat theihna tûrin ka rawn thawn a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lungngaihna thlentu hian kei chang mi tilungngai a ni lo, eng emaw chenah in za-in a tilungngai che u a ni ti ila, ka uar lutuk lâwng chu maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi tam zâwkin hetianga in hrem hi a tâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, khawngaih ula, thlamuan tawh zâwk rawh u; chuti lo zawng, lungngaih lutuk vângin a beidawng dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah chu in hmangaih a ni tih lantîr tûrin ka ngên a che u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kawng tinrêngah thu in awihin fiah in dâwl tih ka hriat theih nân lehkha kha ka rawn thawn che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu pawh in ngaihdam apiang kei pawhin ka ngaidam ve a; tu pawh ka lo ngaihdam a, eng pawh ka lo ngaihdam tawh chu nangmahni avângin Krista hmaa ngaidam ka ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />chutilo zawng, Setanan min dinchan khalh dah ang e, a tum chu kan hai si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Krista Chanchin Ṭha hril tûra Troas khua ka thlen khân, Lalpa chuan rawngbâwlna kawng mi hawnsak na a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ka unaupa Tita ka hmuh loh avângin ka mangang êm êm a; tichuan, anni chu chibai ka bûk a, Makedonia ramah ka kalsan leh ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian hnênah lâwmthu awm rawh se. Ani chuan Krista zâra hnehtu kawng zawhnaah min hruai zêl a; Krista hriatna rimtui hmun tina lên chhuahtîrtuah min hmang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chhandam mêkte leh boral mêkte tân Pathian hnêna Krista rimtui hlan chu kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Boral mêkte tân chuan thihna tûra thih theihna rimchhia kan ni a, chhandam mêkte tân erawh chuan nunna tûra nun theihna rimtui kan ni. Chûng atân chuan tu nge tling ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi tam takin Pathian thu hi sumdâwn nân an hmang angin keini zawngin kan hmang ve lo ve; Pathian tirhin, Pathian hmuhah, Kristaah chuan tihtakzetin thu kan sawi zâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mahni insawimawi kan ṭan leh ta em ni? A nih loh leh, mi dangte ang bawkin sawimawina lehkha kan rawn ken emaw, in hnên ata kan lâk emaw a ṭûl ta em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangni hi kan lehkha, kan thinlung chhûnga ziak, mi tin hriat leh chhiar chu in ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangni hi Krista lehkha, keimahni min ziaktîr, lehkhatuia ziak ni lo, Pathian nung Thlarauva ziak, lung phêka ziak ni lo, tisa thinlung phêka ziak chu in ni tih a lang chiang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Krista zârah chutiang tak chuan Pathian kan ring a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keimahni ngawt chuan kan tlin lo va, keimahni tih anga sawi tûr eng mah a awm hek lo, kan tlin theihna chu Pathian min pek a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chuan Thuthlung Thar rawngbâwl tlâkah min siam a, chu chu Dân, hawrawpa ziak ang kha a ni lo ve; Thuthlung Thar, Thlarauva ziak chu a ni zâwk. Dân, hawrawpa ziak khân thihna a thlen a, Thlarauva ziak erawh chuan nunna a thlen a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mosia hmêl êng, reh leh mai tûr pawh Israel faten an en reng ngam loh khawpin a ropui a; lunga hawrawpa ziak, thihna thlentu rawngbâwlna mah khati taka ropui a nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thlarau rawngbâwlna chu a ropui lehzual dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thiam loh chantîrna rawngbâwlna mah a ropui chuan, thiam chantîrna rawngbâwlna chu a va ropui dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chumi kawngah chuan, ropui taka kha, a aia ropui zâwk daih a lo awm tâk avângin a ropui reng tawh lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Reh leh ta mai mah kha chuti taka ropui a nih chuan, awm hlen tûr chu engti takin ropui ang maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutiang beiseina chu kan neih avângin keini zawng kan huai êm êm a ni. Mosia tih ang khân kan ti lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani chuan a hmêl êng a reh thlenga Israel faten an en reng loh nân, hmaikhuhnain a hmai a khuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An rilru pawh a chawlawl a ni, vawiin thleng hian Thuthlung Hlui bu an chhiar apiangin chu khuhna chuan a la khuh reng a ni: Kristaah chauh chu khuhna chu lâk bo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tûn thlengin Mosia lehkhabu an chhiar apiangin chu khuhna chuan an thinlung chu a la khuh reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpa Isua lam an hawi hun apiangah chu khuhna chu lâk bo a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chu Thlarau a ni a, Lalpa Thlarau awmna apiangah zalênna a awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, keini, hmai khuh lohva awm zawng zawng hian Lalpa ropuina chu kan lantîr a, ropuina aṭanga ropui deuh deuh atân ama anpuia awm tûrin tihdanglam kan ni - chu chu Lalpa tih a ni a, ani chu Thlarau a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, khawngaihna zâra he rawngbâwl hna hi kan hmuh avângin kan zâm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil zahpuiawm, a rûka an tih ṭhinte chu kan hnâwl a. Fin vervêk thawhin Pathian thu a dik lo zâwnga sawi kan chîng ve hek lo. Thutak kan târlang a, Pathian hmaah mi tin chhia leh ṭha hriatna mittlunga awm kan tum zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan Chanchin Ṭha hril hi khuh a nih pawhin, boral mêkte tân chauh khuh a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Krista chu Pathian anpui ngei a ni a; mahse, Krista ropuina Chanchin Ṭha êng chu hmu lo tûrin tûnlai khawvêl pathian hian ring lote rilru mit chu a tihdelsak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keimahni chanchin kan hril lo va, Isua Krista chu Lalpa a nih thu kan hril zâwk ṭhîn, keini pawh Isua avânga in bawih kan nih thu kan hril bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian ropuina Isua Krista hmêla lo lang chu kan hriat chian theih nân, “Thimah êng lo awm rawh se,” titu Pathian chuan kan thinlungte hi a chhun êng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, he thiltihtheihna ropui tak hi keimahnia chhuak ni lovin, Pathiana chhuak a ni zâwk tih a lan chian theih nân, chu ro chu hlumbêlah kan vawng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kawng tinrêngah nêk chêpin kan awm a, nêk beh zawng kan ni si lo; tihmanganin kan awm a, kan bei a dawng hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tihduhdahin kan awm a; mahse, kalsan kan ni si lo; vuak thlûkin kan awm a; mahse, tihhlum zawng kan ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isuaa nunna chu kan taksaah hian a lan theih nân, a thihna pawh kan taksaah hian kan pu reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Isua nunna chu kan taksa thi theiah hian a lan theih nân, keini nungdama awmte pawh hi Isua avânga thi tûra tih kan ni fo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, keimahniah hian thihnain a thawk ṭhîn a, nangmahniah erawh chuan nunnain a thawk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-in, “Ka ring a, chuvângin ka sawi a ni,” a ti a; chutiang rinna thinlung chu puin keini pawhin kan ring a, thu kan sawi ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa Isua kaithotu chuan keini pawh Isua nên min kaitho ve ang a, nangniho nên a hmaah min dintîr dâwn tih kan hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawng hi in ṭhatna tûr a ni a; tichuan, mi tam tak zîngah Pathian khawngaihna a pung ang a, Pathian ropuina tûrin lâwmthu sawina pawh nasa takin a pung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan kan zâm lo ve, kan pâwn lam mihring hi awngrawp telh telh mah sela, kan chhûng lam mihring chu ni tin siam tharin a awm zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rei lo te chhûnga kan hrehawm tuar nêp tak hian chatuan ropuina, khaikhin rual loh khawpa nasa chu min siamsak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thil hmuh theihte chu kan thlîr lo va, thil hmuh theih lohte chu kan thlîr zâwk si a. Thil hmuh theihte chu a ral mai dâwn a, thil hmuh theih lohte erawh chu chatuanin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leia kan taksa hi tihchhiat ni mah sela, taksa hlun, kuta siam ni lo, chatuana awm tûr, Pathian buatsaih chu kan nei dâwn tih kan hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tûnah hi zawng vâna kan awm huna taksa ropui kan neih tûr chu neih thuah châkin he taksaah hian kan rûm ṭhîn a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutiang taksa kan neih hunah chuan saruakin kan awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />He lei taksaa kan awm chhûng hian thawpikin kan rûm ṭhîn, he taksa hi chân kan duh vâng a ni lo va, vân taksa neih thuah kan châk vâng a ni; tichuan, thi thei hi nunnain a lem zo tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian ngei chuan chumi atân chuan min buatsaih a, a zakham nân Thlarau min pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, taksaa kan awm chhûng hian Lalpa hnênah kan la awm rih lo mai a ni tih hriain, huai takin kan awm fo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmuh theih hian min hruai lo va, rinnain min hruai zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai takin kan awm a, amaherawhchu, taksaa awm lova Lalpa hnêna awm kan thlang zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, taksain kan awm emaw, awm lo emaw, ama lâwmzâwng mi nih kan tum tlat ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan vaiin Krista rorêlna hmaah kan lang vek dâwn si a, he dam chhûnga kan thil tih man, a chhia emaw, a ṭha emaw, kan hmuh ṭheuh theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa hlauhawmzia hriain, ring tûrin mite kan thlêm ṭhîn a ni; Pathian chuan min hre fai vek a, nangni pawhin in thinlung tak chuan min hriat chian ka ring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In hnênah kan insawimawi leh ta a ni lo; thinlung lam ni lo, pâwn lam thil mai chhuangtute chu in chhân theih nân, keimahnia chhuan tûr ṭha kan hrilh che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan lo â a nih pawhin Pathian tân a ni a, kan lo fing a nih erawh chuan in tân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Krista hmangaihna chuan min hneh khawp a, heti hian kan ngaihtuah: mi zawng zawng tân mi pakhat a thi a; chuvângin; mi zawng zawng thi an lo ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tichuan, a nungte chu anmahni tâna nung tawh lovin, an tâna thi-a tholeha tân an nun tawh zâwk nân, mi zawng zawng tân a thi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, tûn chinah chuan tisa takin tu mah kan en tawh lo. Hmânah tisa takin Krista chu lo hre ṭhîn mah ila, tûnah zawng chutiangin kan ngai tawh lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi tu pawh Kristaa an awm chuan thilsiam thar an lo ni a, thil hluite chu an ral a, ngai teh, an lo thar ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawng hi Pathian tih vek a ni: ani chuan Krista zârah amah nên inremin min awmtîr a, inremna rawngbâwl hna chu min pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pathianin Kristaah khawvêl hi amah nên a inremtîr a, an bawhchhiatnate chu bawhchhiatnaah a chhiar tawh lo va, chu inremna thu puan hna chu kan kovah a nghat ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, Krista aiawha palai kan ni a: Pathianin keimahni min hmangin a ngên a che u, “Pathian nên lo inrem rawh u,” tiin, Krista aiawhin kan ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama zârah Pathian ṭhatna kan lo chan ve theih nân, sual rêng rêng hre lo chu, keimahni avângin Pathianin sualah a siam a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian khawngaihna in dawn chu ṭangkaipui ngei tûrin, keini amah thawhpuitute hian kan ngên a che u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“A hun takah ka ngaithla che a, Chhandamna ni-ah ka ṭanpui che,” a ti si a. Ngai teh u, tûn hi a hun tak chu a ni a, tûn hi chhandamna ni chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan rawngbâwl hna hi miten an dem loh nân an ngaimawh zâwng eng mah kan ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan tih apiangah Pathian rawngbâwltute ni âwm rêngin mi mittlungin kan awm zâwk ṭhîn. Tihduhdahna te, hrehawm te, nêkchêp te chhel takin kan tuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vuak kan tuar a, lung inah kan tâng a, tlâng chîl kan tâwk a, mutmu pawh tuah thei lovin kan thawk rim a, chaw kan tlachham a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thianghlimnaah te, hriatnaah te, ṭhatnaah te, ngilneihnaah te, Thlarau Thianghlimah te, hmangaihna tak takah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />thu dik sawiah te, Pathian thiltihtheihna kan hman dânah te, Pathian rawngbâwltute ni âwm rêngin kan awm a: felna râlthuam chu ding lam leh vei lama kengin kan ṭang ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngaih ropui kan hlawh a, ngaih nêp kan hlawh bawk a; min fak a, min dem bawk a; thu dik kan sawi a, bumtu-ah min ngai bawk si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tu khaw hriat tham kan ni lo va; mahse, mi tinin min hre bawk si. Thi ang kan ni a; mahse, kan nung si; thunun kan tâwk a, tihhlum kan ni si lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />lungngaihna kan tawhin lâwmna tûr kan nei zêl si; pachhe hle mah ila mi dang kan tihausa si; eng mah kan nei lo va, engkim kan ta a ni bawk si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Korinth mite u, thinlung inhawng takin in hnênah thu kan sawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eng mah zêp kan nei lo va, nangmahni in inhawng lo a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Fate hnêna thu sawi angin sawi ta ila, nangni pawh keimahni angin inhawng ve rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ring lo mite thurualpui suh u. Dikna leh sualnain inṭâwm theih eng mah an nei lo, êng leh thim pawh a inkawp thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Krista leh Beliara pawhin inlaichînna eng nge an neih? Ringtu leh ring lovin eng nge chan dun an neih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian Tempul leh milemte pawhin eng nge inzawmna an neih? Keini zawng Pathian nung Tempul kan ni si a. Pathianin, “Anmahniah ka awm ang a, ka chên chilh ang; An Pathian ka ni ang a, anni pawh ka mite an ni ang,” a tih ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, “ ‘An zîng ata lo chhuak ula, a hrangin awm rawh u, Thil bawlhhlawh pawh khawih suh u,’ Lalpan a ti.” Chutichuan, “ ‘Ka lâwm ang che u a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In tân Pa ka ni ang a, Nangni pawh ka tân fanu fapa in ni ang,’ Lalpa Engkimtitheia chuan a ti.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, duh takte u, chu thutiam chu kan neih avângin, taksa leh thlarau lam bawlhhlawhna zawng zawng ata intifai ila, Pathian ṭihin thianghlimnaah chuan i puitling ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In thinlungah hmun mi kian rawh u, tu pawi mah kan khawih ngai lo va, tu mah kan tichhe ngai lo va, tu mah kan bum ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thiam loh chantîr tûr che uin chu chu ka sawi lo va; ka hrilh tawh che u angin kan thinlungah in awm tlat a, nangni nên chuan thih tlân emaw, dam tlân emaw kan huam asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In zîngah ka tlângnêl êm êm a, ka chhuang hle bawk che u a, ka thlamuang êm êm a ni; hrehawm tinrêng kan tuarnaah pawh lâwmin ka khat bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Makedonia ram kan lo thlen pawh khân kan hah a dam chuang lo; hrehawm tinrêng kan tâwk zâwk a, pâwn lamah min bei an awm a, chhûng lamah hlauhthâwnnaten min chîm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, mi chanhaite thlamuantu Pathian chuan Tita lo thleng hmangin min thlamuan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lo thlen vâng chauh ni lovin, nangmahni avânga a thlamuanna pawh chuan min thlamuan bawk a ni; min ngaihzia te, min tuarpuizia te, kan tâna ṭhahnem in ngaihzia te min hrilh a, chu chuan mi tithlamuang lehzual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka lehkha khân in thin a tina tih ka lo hriatin ka inchhîr hman deuh va; mahse, kha lehkha khân rei lo te chauh a tina che u tih ka lo hriat leh thuai avângin ka inchhîr leh ta lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûnah chuan ka lâwm ta, in thin ka tihnat vâng ni lovin, pawi in tih avânga in sim ta hi ka lâwmna chu a ni zâwk; chutianga in tuar chu Pathian duhzâwng a ni si a; keimahni avângin eng mah in chân hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian duhzâwng anga lungngaihna hian chhandamna tûra simna a thlen a, inchhîrawm lo tak a ni. Mihring taka lungngaihna erawh chuan thihna a thlen ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Pathian duhzâwng anga in lungngaihna hian ṭhahnem a va ngaih nasattîr che u êm! In dikzia tihlan duhna te, sual huatna leh sual tih hlauhna te in nei ta a; min ngaihna te, ṭhahnemngaihna te, mi sual hrem duhna te in neih thar tâk hi! Tûnah chuan he thilah hian in inhnamhnawih ve lo tih nangmahni ngeiin in tilang chiang ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In hnêna ka lehkhathawn kha thil sual titu avâng emaw, a tihsual tuartu avâng emawa ziak ka ni lo va, Pathian mit hmuha kan tân ṭhahnem in ngaihzia nangmahni ngeiin in hmuhchhuah theih nân ka ziak a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, kan thlamuang ta a ni; Tita lâwmna avângin kan hlim lehzual a, in za-in a rilru in tihahdam êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tita hnênah hian ka chhuang hle ṭhîn che u a, ka tisual lo ve; thu dik tak in hnênah ka sawi ṭhîn a, Tita hnêna kan chhuang che u pawh hi kan lo tidik e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, in zaa a thu in awihzia te, hlau leh khûr chunga amah in lo lawm dân te hre rengin a lainat lehzual che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kawng tinrêngah ka rin ngam tâk che u avângin ka lâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute u, Pathianin Makedonia rama Kohhrante khawngaihna a pêk thu hi kan hrilh duh che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hrehawm nasa taka fiah an ni chungin an lâwm ta êm êm a, an pachhe hle chung pawhin an thilphal êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An neih tlin tâwk an pe mai ni lovin, an tlin tâwk aia tam daih an pe tih ka hriatpui a ni. Chu chu anmahni duh thu ngeia ti an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi thianghlimte chhawmdâwlna tûr rawngbâwl hnaah hian tel ve mi dîl chiam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />chu chu kan lo beisei phâk loh a ni; Lalpa hnênah anmahni an inhlân phawt a, chumi hnuah Pathian duhzâwng angin kan hnênah an intulût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, hmâna a lo tih ṭan tawh, in zînga chhawmdâwlna thawhlâwm khawn chu, rawn ti zo nghâl tûrin Tita hi ka ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rinnaah te, thu-ah te, hriatnaah te, ṭhahnemngaih ṭûlna tinrêngah te, min hmangaihnaah te, kawng engkimah hma in hruai ṭhîn ang khân, he hmangaihna rawngbâwl hnaah pawh hian ṭhahnemngaih chhuah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thu pe zâwnga ti ka ni lo va, thil pêk lama mi dang thathozia enin in hmangaihna tak leh tak loh a lan fiah nân ka sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna ngahzia chu in hria e; a retheihna avânga in lo hausak theih nân, hausa hle mah se, nangmahni avâng ngeiin a lo retheih tâk kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngaih dân ka han sawi ang e, nikuma in tih ṭan kha tûnah ti zo ula in tân a ṭha ang. A tih tum hmasa ber chauh in ni lo va, a ṭan hmasa ber pawh in nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tîra in inhuam ang khân, in neih dân ang zêla pein ṭhahnemngai takin tûnah hlen chhuak rawh u le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Miin a neih loh pui ni lovin, a neih aṭanga phal taka pêk a nih chuan a lâwmawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi dang chhâwk zân nân nangni hah ula ka ti a ni lo, inchhâwk tawn a ṭûl thu ka sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tûnah nangnin in ngah lai hian an tlâkchhamna in phuhrûksak a, anni pawhin an ngah ve hunah in tlâkchhamna an la phuhrûksak ve ang che u; tichuan, in inchhâwk tawn dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“A chhar tam chuan a nei tam chuang lo va, a chhar tlêm lahin a tlachham hek lo,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />In tâna ka ṭhahnemngaihna ang, Tita thinlunga dahtu Pathian hnênah lâwmthu awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chuan kan ngen avâng mai ni lovin, a ṭhahnemngaihna avâng zâwkin, ama thu ngeiin in hnênah lo kal a tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A rual hian unau pakhat kan rawn tîr ve a, ani hi Chanchin Ṭha hril thu-ah Kohhranho zawng zawngin an fak hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu chauh pawh a ni lo va, Lalpa ropui nâna ṭhahnemngai taka he chhawmdâwl rawngbâwl hna thawka kan zinpui atân Kohhranten an thlan chhuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutiang chuan miten phal taka an pêk, tam tham tak hi kan buaipuinaah dem kai loh hrâm hrâm kan tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa hmuha mawi chauh ni lovin, mihring hmuha mawi pawh kan ngaihtuah bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, kan unaupa pawh hi an rualin kan rawn tîr bawk a ni; ani pawh hian ṭhahnem a ngaihzia kawng tam takah a tilang fo tawh a; tûnah phei chuan a rin êm che u avângin lo kal a châk lehzual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tita hi chu ka ṭhian leh in rawng mi bâwlpuitu a ni a, kan unaute pawh hi kohhran palai an ni a, Krista ropuina an nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kohhranten hmangaihna in neihzia hi an hmuha, kan fakna che u hi a dikzia an hriat theih nân an chungah in hmangaihna lo lantîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi thianghlimte rawngbâwlsak thu hi in hnêna ziak tam a ngai lo ve,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ṭanpui in peihzia ka hre si a. “Nikum khân Akaia ram chu an inpuahchah tawh,” tiin, nangmahni chhuang takin Makedonia rama mite ka hrilh ṭhîn a, in ṭhahnemngaihna chuan mi tam tak a tiharh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />He thilah hian ka fak sual loh nân che u leh ka sawi ang ngeia in lo inpeih theih nân unaute hi ka rawn tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Makedonia rama mite kan rualin lo kal ve ta sela, in la inpeih lo tih an rawn hmuh chuan, kan rin tehlul che u vei nên, in tân chauh ni lovin, kan tân pawh a zahthlâk hle dâwn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thawhlâwm in tiam tawh sate kha lo ching fel diam tûrin unaute hi rawn tirh hmasak ṭûlin ka hria a; in lo inpeih chuan in thil pêkte chu lâk luihsak che u ang ni lovin, nangmahni thu ngeia pêk a ni tih a lang chiang dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hre rawh u, hetiang kawngah hian tuh tlêm chuan a seng tlêm ang a, tuh tam erawh chuan a seng tam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi tinin an rilrua an tum sa ang chu ui lovin, tih luih ang ni hek lovin pe ṭheuh rawh se; Pathian chuan lâwm taka petu a ni a hmangaih ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian chuan in mamawh thil ṭha tinrêng a pe ṭeuh thei che u a, in mamawh aia tam pawh thil ṭha in tih theih nân a pêk belhchhah thei che u a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“A sem darh a, tlachhamte a pe a, a ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a pângngai reng a ni,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh atâna chi petu leh ei atâna chaw petu chuan chi a pe ṭeuh vang che u, a ṭhantîr ang a, in thilphalna rah chu a tipung bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kawng tinrênga thilphal hle tûrin a tihausa ang che u; tin, keimahni hmanga in thil pêk vâng hian Pathian hnênah lâwmthu an la sawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In chhawmdâwl rawngbâwl hna hian mi thianghlimte mamawh a phuhrûksak chauh ni lovin, Pathian hnêna lâwmthu sawina pawh nasa takin a tipung bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />He in rawngbâwl hna hian Krista Chanchin Ṭha in pawma in zawmzia te, an tân leh mi dang zawng zawng tân in thilphalzia te a tilang a, chu chuan Pathian a chawimawitîr ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anni pawhin Pathian khawngaihna in dawn nasat êm avâng hian duhsak takin in tân an ṭawngṭai ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thilpêk sawi hleih theih loh avâng hian Pathian hnênah lâwmthu awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hmaichhana nêm tak, râlkhata paukhauh tak si,” in tih kei Paula ngei hian, Krista thuhnuairawlhna leh nunnêmna chhâlin ka ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tisa taka khawsaa mi puhtute chungah khauh takin ka awm ngam dâwn tih ka inhre si a, ka lo kal hunah chutianga ka awm a ṭûl loh nân ka ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawvêla awm zawng kan ni ngei e; mahse, khawvêl rilru pua bei kan ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Indona hriamhrei kan hman hi khawvêl thil a ni lo va, kulhpui ṭhiat theihna Pathian hriamhrei thiltithei tak a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An ṭanhmun kan ṭhiatsak zêl a, Pathian hriatna kawng chapo taka dodâltu apiang kan tudawl a, ngaihtuahna tinrêng Krista bawihah kan siam bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, thu in awih zân hnuah a la awih lote chu hrem tûrin kan inpeih reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lan dân aṭang maiin thil in thlîr a. Tu-in emaw Krista ta ni bîkah a inruat chuan inngaihtuah nawn teh se; Krista ta a ni ang bawkin keini pawh kan ni ve asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In chhiatna tûr ni lo, nangmahni tundin nâna Lalpan thuneihna mi pêk hi ka lo chhuang lutuk deuh pawh a ni ang e; mahse, ka inzahpui lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lehkhathawna nangmahni tihṭhaih tumah mi ngai suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“A lehkha thute chu a ritin a khauh va, amah kan hmuh meuh chuan pa awmnêm tê, a thu sawi lah sitawm tak a ni si,” tite in awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutianga ngaitute chuan hei hi hre rawh se; in hnêna kan lo kal hmaa lehkhathawna ka rawn sawi ang tak khân, kan lo kal hunah pawh kan rawn ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mahni insawimawi ṭhenkhatte zîngah chuan kan inchhiar tel ve ngam lo, anni nên kan inteh ngam hek lo. Mahni inteh nân bi an inthliah chawp a, chu chuan mahni leh mahni an inteh a, a va âtthlâk êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keini zawng kan thawhna hmuna mite bâk kan chhuang dâwn lo, Pathianin ri min khamsak chhûnga mi chauh kan chhuang zâwk ang, nangni pawh a huam tel si che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan bial chin in nih avângin Krista Chanchin Ṭha in hnênah kan rawn thlen a, a piah lamah kan kal loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan bial piah lama mi dang thawh kan uanpui lo ve. In rinna a lo ṭhang ang a, thil ropui zâwk in zîngah tih a la ni ang, kan bial pawh a zau zêl ang tih kan beisei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, in ram piah lamah pawh Chanchin Ṭha chu kan la hril zêl ang; amaherawhchu, mi thawh sa chu kan uanpui lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A chhuang apiangin Lalpa chu chhuang rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mahni insawimawite chu ngaihsân tûr an ni lo va; Lalpan a chawimawite chu ngaihsân tûr an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka â deuh a nih pawhin mi dawhtheih ka duh hle, dawh pawh mi dawhthei hle e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasal pakhat, Krista chu ka hualsak tawh che u a, a hnêna nula thianghlim anga ka hlan theihna tûr che uin, Pathian thîkthu a chhiat avângin asin in lakah kei pawh ka thîkthu a chhiat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rûlin Evi ngamthlêma a bum ang khân, Krista lama in rilru thianghlim leh mawi tak kha eng emaw ti mai maiin an tikhawlo vang tih ka hlau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan hril ṭhin ni lo Isua dang hrila lo kal kha in lo lâwm thei a. Thlarau dang in chan ngai loh chu in pawm thei a, in pawm tawh ang ni lo Chanchin Ṭha dang pawh in ngaithei zêl mai maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûng ‘tirhkoh lian’ in tihte pawh chu eng kawngah mah tluk loh ka inring lo asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thu sawi thiam ve lo mah ila hriatna lamah chuan ka duai bîk lo tih in hnênah kawng tinrêngin, eng hunah pawh ka tihlan ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nih loh leh, chawisân in nih theih nân mahni indah hniama Pathian mi pêk Chanchin Ṭha a thlâwna ka hrilh che u khân, thil sual ka ti a lo ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In zînga rawng ka bâwl theih nân Kohhran dang ka pûr a ṭûl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In hnêna ka awm lai khân ka tlâkchham thu-ah tu mah ka tihautak lo che u, ka mamawh chu Makedonia ram aṭanga unau lo kalten mi rawn pe zêl a ni; tihhautak loh che u ka tum tlat ṭhîn a, ka tum zêl bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keimaha Krista thutak awm chu ṭanchhanin ka sawi a ni; Akaia ram chhûnga he ka thil chhuan hi tu man mi tihtâwpsak thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eng vângin maw? Ka hmangaih loh che u vâng em ni? Pathianin ka hmangaihzia che u chu a hria alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan thawh ang chiaha thawk nia insawi duhten chhuan tûr eng mah an neih loh nân ka tih ṭhin ang hi ka ti zêl dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chûng mite chu tirhkoh tak ni lo, mi bum tuma thawk, Krista tirhkohva insiam chawpte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chu chu a mak lo ve. Setana meuh pawh êng tirhkohvah a insiam chawp ṭhîn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvângin, Setana rawngbâwltute chu felna rawngbâwltu anga insiam chawp a har lo ve, an tâwpna tûr erawh chu an thiltihin a la tilang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Han sawi zêl ila, mi â angah mi lo ngai lo ula, mi ngai a nih pawhin mi â angin mi lo en mai ula, ka han uang ve hlek teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka sawi hi Lalpa mi sawitîr zawng a ni lo ve, mi â angin ka thil chhuan hi ka sawi dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi tam takin khawvêl thil an uanpui ṭhîn a, kei pawhin ka han uanpui ve teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangni zawng in fing a, mi â-te pawh lâwm takin in dawh thiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Miin bawihah siam che u sela, ei zo che u sela, bum che u sela, hmusit che uin in hmaiah bêng che u mah se in dawh zêl thei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutianga kan lo ti ve ngam lo chu a zahthlâk hle mai. Â takin han sawi ta ila: Tu pawhin eng pawh an ngam apiang kei pawhin ka ngam asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hebrai mi an ni maw? Kei pawh ka ni. Israel mi an ni maw? Kei pawh ka ni; Abrahama thlahte an ni maw? Kei pawh ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Krista rawngbâwltute an ni maw? Â takin han sawi ta ila, ka ni lehzual - a thawk rim hlei hlei ka ni a, tân inah te ka tâng zing zâwk a, vuak lah ka tuar tam zâwk daih a, thih mai theihna pawh ka tâwk tam zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Juda-te tih dân angin vawi khata vawi sawmli tling lo vuak ṭum nga ka tuar a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ṭum thum tiangin mi vua a, ṭum khat lungin mi dêng a, ṭum thum lawng chhiat ka tâwk a, ni khat leh zan khat tuifinriatah ka hmang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka zinna lamah luia hlauhawm te, suamhmang laka hlauhawm te, ka chipuite laka hlauhawm te, Jentail-te laka hlauhawm te, khawpuia hlauhawm te, thlalêra hlauhawm te, tuipuia hlauhawm te, unau derte laka hlauhawm te ka tâwk fo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />thawk rimin ka buai a, mut pawh hmu lovin vawi tam tak ka awm a, rilṭâm leh tuihâl ka tuar a, sin tûr nei lovin khaw vâwt ka tuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hêng bâkah hian, Kohhranho zawng zawng ka ngaihtuahna, ni tin mi delh rengtu a awm bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi chak lote ka tuarpui lo ngai em ni? Mi an tlûkin ka vei lo ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chhuang tûr ka nih vêk chuan ka chak lohzia tilangtute hi a ni ka chhuan zâwk dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian, Lalpa Isua Pa chuan dâwt ka sawi lohzia a hria. Amah chu chatuana fakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Damaska khuaah erawh kha chuan lal Areta hnuaia rorêltu chuan mi man tumin Damaska khua chu a vêntîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />mahse, kulh bang tukverh aṭang chuan bâwmin mi thlâk thla a; tichuan, a kut ata ka chhuak ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sâwt chuang lo mah se, ka han uang ve teh ang. Ka hnêna Lalpa inlârna leh a thu puan ka han sawi zêl teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh pali a ni ta, Kristaa awm mi pakhat ka hria - chu mi chu vân thumna meuhva hruai chhohvin a awm a, a hringhrânin a ni nge ni lo tih erawh chu ka hre lo, Pathianin a hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu mi ngei chu Paradis-ah hruai chhohvin a awm a, a tak nge zêl tih chu ka hre lo, Pathianin a hria; chu mi chuan mihringte sawi thian loh leh sawi hleih theih loh thu a hria tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutiang mi chu ka chhuang dâwn; nimahsela, ka chak lohnate lo chu mahni ka inchhuang dâwn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Inchhuang duh pawh ni ila âtthlâk a ni lo vang, thu tak tak ka sawi si a; mahse, ka insûm ang, chutilo chuan, mi hmuh ang leh ka laka thu an hriat ang aiin mi ngai ropui zâwk dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thil mi hriattîr chu a ropui êm vânga ka inngaihhlut luattuk loh nân ka tisaah hian hlîng mi pe a, chu chu Setana tirhkoh, ka inngaihhlut loh nâna mi kap reng tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu chu mi lâk kiansak tûrin vawi thum Lalpa ka dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan, “ka khawngaihna i tân a tâwk e, ka thiltihtheihna hi chak lohnaah asin tihpuitlina a awm ṭhin,” mi ti a. Chuvângin, Krista thiltihtheihna chu keimaha a chên theih nân ka chak lohnate hi lâwm takin ka chhuang tawh zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Krista avâng chuan chak lohnaah te, tihduhdahnaah te, harsatnaah te ka lâwm ṭhîn a ni; ka chak loh veleh ka lo chak leh ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi â ang mai ka nih tâk hi, nangnin â lo thei lovin mi siam a ni; dik tak chuan nangni hi asin mi sawimawitu tûrte chu. Eng mah ni lo mah ila, eng kawngah mah ‘tirhkoh lian’ in tihte chu ka tluk lo bîk lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tirhkoh ka nih chhinchhiahna chu chhinchhiahna te, thil mak te, thil ropui tak tak te kawng tinrênga dawhthei taka in zînga ka tih ṭhin kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eng kawngah nge kohhran dangte aia ka ngaihnêp zâwk che u? Ka tihhautak loh vâng che u kha em ni? Ka lo tidik lo a nih chuan mi ngaidam rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai teh u, tûn hi in hnêna lo kal ka inpeih vawi thumna a ni. Ka tihautak lo vang che u, in thil neih ka ngiat lo, nangmahni hi a ni ka duh ber chu. Faten nu leh pa tân an khâwlsak ngai lo va, nu leh paten fate tân an khâwlsak zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei zawng, in thlarau tân lâwm takin ka inhmangral ang a, ka inpe zo vek ang. Ka hmangaih nasat êm che u avângin mi hmangaih nêp dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka tihhautak lohzia che u kha in hria a; mahse, depde taka bumtu che u ka lo ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In zînga ka rawn tirh tu emaw tal hmangin in lak aṭanga hlâwkna ka nei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tita chu in hnêna lo kal tûrin ka ngên a, ama rualin unau pakhat ka rawn tîr bawk a. Tita chuan hlâwk phah nân a hmang che u em ni? Rilru hmun khat pua thawk dûn, hniakhnung inzui chiah kan ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mahni insawi thiamah mi lo ngai ṭhîn a ni maw? Pathian hmuhin Kristaah thu kan sawi ṭhîn a ni a. Duh takte u, engkim hi nangmahni siam ṭhat nân ka ti ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka lo kal hunah ka tum angin ka rawn hmu lo vang che u a, kei pawh in tum angin min hmu lo vang tih ka hlau va ni; inhauna te, inîtsîkna te, thinurna te, inerna te, insawichhiatna te, inrêlna te, chapona te, buaina te in zîngah ka la rawn hmu fo vang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ka lo kal leh hunin in hmaah ka Pathianin mi timualpho vang a, tûn hma lama thil sual tite, an thil bawlhhlawh tih - inngaih te, hur te sim si lo mi tam tak avângin ka ṭap dah ang tih ka hlau bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tûn hi in hnêna ka lo kal vawi thumna tûr a ni. “Thuhretu pahnih emaw, pathum emaw kâ aṭang chauhvin thubuai rêng rêng tihfel tûr a ni,” tih a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In hnêna ka lo kal vawi hnihnaah khân thil sual titute leh mi dang zawng zawng hnênah ka sawi lâwk tawh a, in zîngah awm rih lo mah ila, ka hrilh lâwk a che u; ka lo kal hun chuan thil sual titute chu ka zuah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keimah mi hmangin Krista chuan thu a sawi a ni tih fiahna in zawn chu in la hmu ang. Krista chu in zînga a hna thawhah a duai lo va, thil nasa taka titheitu a nih zâwk kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chu chak lohna avângin khenbeh a ni a, Pathian thiltihtheihna avângin a nung leh ta a ni. Keini pawh amahah chuan kan chak lo va; nimahsela, in tâna kan rawngbâwlnaah Pathian thiltihtheihna avângin amah nên thil kan ti ve thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rinnaah chuan in awm emaw, mahni infiah ula, mahni inchhin ṭhîn rawh u. Krista Isua chu nangmahniah a awm tih hriatna in nei lâwm ni? Inhriatna in nei lo a nih chuan a lem mai in la ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keini erawh chu a lem mai kan ni ve lo tih in hriat ka beisei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thil sual eng mah in tih loh nân Pathian hnênah kan ṭawngṭaisak ṭhîn che u a ni; hlawhtling bîk nia kan lan theihna tûr a ni lo, hlawhchham angin lang mah ila thil ṭha in tih theihna tûrin kan dîl zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thutak ṭan tûr lo chuan a do zâwngin eng mah kan ti thei si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keini kan chak loh pawhin nangni in chak chuan kan lâwm ṭhîn asin. Hei hi kan dîl bawk ṭhîn - in ṭhat zâwk zêlna tûr hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichhe tûr che u ni lovin, siam ṭha tûr zâwkin Lalpan thuneihna min pe a, in hnêna ka lo kal huna chu thuneihna chu ka lek vak a ṭûl loh nân ka lo kal hmain hêng thu hi ka ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unaute u, dam takin u le; insiam ṭha ula, ka ngenna che u hi pawisa ula, rilru hmun khat pu ula, inrem takin awm rawh u; tichuan, hmangaihna leh remna Pathian chuan a awmpui ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fawh thianghlimin chibai inbûk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi thianghlim zawng zawngte hian chibai an bûk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna te, Pathian hmangaihna te, Thlarau Thianghlim pâwlna te chu in zaa hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
